---
description: Use agent-skills workflows from .cursor/skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work (speckit/`.specify` is retired — this pack replaces it):

1. Route via `.cursor/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`.
2. Read and follow the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (symlink → `.agents/skills/`).
3. Open `reference.md` / `references/*.md` in that folder when the skill links to it.
4. Prefer project skills over guessing; user does not need to say "read skill" each time.

ClearDue non-negotiables: human approval gate (sweep queues `pending_approval`, nothing sends without Approve + Send), 1 credit/invoice, secrets never committed, verify with `npx tsc --noEmit` + `npm run build`.
